{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_5_005kao_1_5_005_04",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:65592b1ef6033340c69326e77ecd9f3222edaf5c771a2a43ed3057f566491ef1",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_5_005kao_1_5_005_04:1_5_005_04:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c391997b55a2964fa0fc166f4cc2e2a84ff43baeb6237ada6e314982654dd101",
      "text": "工作中",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_005kao_1_5_005_04:1_5_005_04:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5d3e8fa043af75a87dd4faef01ce8885090903c7489ecb33e70005fc16c71c5",
      "text": "【剧情梗概】",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_005kao_1_5_005_04:1_5_005_04:cmd-000011:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33d8451285d4e5f69626e1f5771ddc007ba751ec655f29067561078d2496c78f",
      "text": "工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_005kao_1_5_005_04:1_5_005_04:cmd-000011:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c9ed63ae2410c9f541409cbb0c7b6b261aad14200a6553b8b672581e10fa1328",
      "text": "头痛药广告的工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_005kao_1_5_005_04:1_5_005_04:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fc76df52fe79b8bada48d98d9701e0439bd4eab5061b568807bcf799837f41a9",
      "text": "“头痛？为什么不早点告诉我。”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_005kao_1_5_005_04:1_5_005_04:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:394fbf37fb0a10da819f192a390cca58478c4984480623fb1f6db020039d77e6",
      "text": "“最近一直很忙吧。\n吃了这个，今天还是早点回去休息比较好。”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_005kao_1_5_005_04:1_5_005_04:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8a48ea7536d322e1a2320601c947175b16a687e22e9bd257d53140f2f345c6f6",
      "text": "“以为会被骂？呵，我知道你一直很努力。\n怎么可能会骂你。”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_005kao_1_5_005_04:1_5_005_04:cmd-000049:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b778da12e44b043eb3a21bef897722f6e5014accfaf2495bacec6def645c7bcf",
      "text": "拍摄后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_005kao_1_5_005_04:1_5_005_04:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:660e205f2aa7c9a241e9ec91f6b9cbdee7f5fb3e54abec0f51d84e0d3ff13a26",
      "text": "辛苦了，薰先生。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_005kao_1_5_005_04:1_5_005_04:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:179ab822addd50ddc52b6186383be5cf43955506797164b7cb4b8e9643e47b47",
      "text": "啊，是你啊。拍摄结束后你好像和工作人员\n聊了挺久的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_005kao_1_5_005_04:1_5_005_04:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4a74b615f64d7373e7bfdf63248523ed0a2e9c7bced59b0be37684a95e7299cb",
      "text": "是的，工作人员对您赞不绝口。\n还特意嘱咐我务必转达给薰先生。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_005kao_1_5_005_04:1_5_005_04:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bf663f6831fdd5bec19c774ab86943d27057a517beafe3b53a0bdc9a347e62e2",
      "text": "还说一定要做成让人憧憬的上司系列呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_005kao_1_5_005_04:1_5_005_04:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e3d9db6345b4d945b4638354c9878a24d33052c068816da4d7e6df860f98da50",
      "text": "系列，吗……\n能得到这样的评价很感激。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_005kao_1_5_005_04:1_5_005_04:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:47fea64ddb6a5f27d55ad23c70930ca1bd43c089fe5bca75fa4064a058df81ad",
      "text": "既然得到了认可，\n为了继续回应这份期待，我也要加倍努力。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_005kao_1_5_005_04:1_5_005_04:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f377e557f6a5542b97dadc53ead387ab26a64876afda0c5ace1f61178262b56c",
      "text": "好的！要是有什么我能帮上忙的，\n请随时告诉我！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
